    [Doc][Misc] Revise accuracy evaluation methods and config details (#20170)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This PR updates the documentation for Qwen3.5-27B and Qwen3.6-27B
    models. Specifically, it:
    - Refines the instructions for using AISBench for accuracy evaluation by
    linking to the detailed guide.
    - Removes the redundant example accuracy evaluation configuration block
    for AISBench to keep the documentation clean and avoid duplication.
    - Removes the redundant `vllm serve` command under the `lm_eval`
    section, as the online service deployment commands are already detailed
    in Section 5.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No. Documentation-only updates are not considered user-facing changes.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation-only changes, no functional code changes.
    
